  "change_note": "First allow-list for why-it-moved notes: regulators, exchanges, the companies on our lists, the big newswires, reputable outlets and a few trade publications.",
  "rules": [
    "Link only to these hosts or their subdomains. Anything else is refused when the note is recorded.",
    "Prefer the official source (the company, a regulator, a newswire release) and add one reputable outlet that explains it.",
    "Skip a page that asks for a login, a subscription or a bot check; never work around it.",
    "Write the note in your own words: no quotation marks, no copied sentences, no digits, no prices or price targets.",
    "Every source must be dated on or before the market day plus one day.",
    "When no source here explains the move, say plainly that no clear cause was found.",
    "A note explains a move. It is never a reason to buy or sell."
  ],
